        },
        {
          "text": "Mehroz K. Pathan",
          "label": "JUDGE",
          "start": 447,
          "end": 463
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "1. Heard the learned Counsel for the Applicant and the learned APP for the State.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 506,
      "end": 587,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "2. The Applicant has approached this Court, seeking anticipatory bail in connection with Crime No.309/2025 registered with Peth Beed Police Station, Tq. and Dist. Beed for the offences punishable under Sections 123, 223, 274, 275 of Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 588,
      "end": 852,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Crime No.309/2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 678,
          "end": 695
        },
        {
          "text": "Peth Beed Police Station, Tq. and Dist. Beed",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 712,
          "end": 756
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 123",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 791,
          "end": 803
        },
        {
          "text": "223",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 805,
          "end": 808
        },
        {
          "text": "274",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 810,
          "end": 813
        },
        {
          "text": "275",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 815,
          "end": 818
        },
        {
          "text": "Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 822,
          "end": 851
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.11777933686971664
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 6,
      "text": "3. On 07.11.2025, Informant Vilas Thombre, Police Head Constable attached to Peth Beed Police Station, lodged a report alleging that on the same day at about 02:00 p.m., he along with Police Head Constable Mane was present at Barshi Naka Chauki.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 853,
      "end": 1099,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "07.11.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 860,
          "end": 870
        },
        {
          "text": "Vilas Thombre",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 882,
          "end": 895
        },
        {
          "text": "Peth Beed Police Station",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 931,
          "end": 955
        },
        {
          "text": "Mane",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1060,
          "end": 1064
        },
        {
          "text": "Barshi Naka Chauki",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1080,
          "end": 1098
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.13012412190437317
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 7,
      "text": "At that time, Pooja Pawar, Dy. S.P., along with other police officers,\n2 930.ABA-2166-2025.doc arrived and informed them that they had received secret information that Sayyed Zaker and Sayyed Shaker, residents of Mominpura, had kept stock of Gutka for sale at their shop, Madina Traders, despite the prohibition imposed by the Maharashtra Government.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1100,
      "end": 1451,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Pooja Pawar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1115,
          "end": 1126
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayyed Zaker",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1269,
          "end": 1281
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayyed Shaker",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1286,
          "end": 1299
        },
        {
          "text": "Mominpura",
          "label": "GPE",
          "start": 1314,
          "end": 1323
        },
        {
          "text": "Gutka",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1343,
          "end": 1348
        },
        {
          "text": "Madina Traders",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1373,
          "end": 1387
        },
        {
          "text": "Maharashtra Government",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1428,
          "end": 1450
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18334044516086578
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "Thereafter, it was decided to raid the said shop.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1453,
      "end": 1502,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2599249482154846
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "All of them reached in front of Madina Traders at about 02:15 p.m. by Government vehicle.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1503,
      "end": 1592,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Madina Traders",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 1535,
          "end": 1549
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.24314822256565094
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "The shop was found closed.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1593,
      "end": 1619,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2925630509853363
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 11,
      "text": "The mobile number displayed on the shop board (9112091011) was dialed to contact Zaker, who stated that he would come shortly,\nbut thereafter disconnected the call.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1620,
      "end": 1784,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Zaker",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 1701,
          "end": 1706
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19150404632091522
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 12,
      "text": "A subsequent call was made, but the phone was switched off.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1785,
      "end": 1844,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2286977469921112
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "Sayyed Mohammad Zakir Sayyed Jalil vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another on 28 January, 2026 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/131788541/",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1845,
      "end": 1995,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Sayyed Mohammad Zakir Sayyed Jalil vs The State Of Maharashtra And Another",
          "label": "PRECEDENT",
          "start": 1846,
          "end": 1920
        },
        {
          "text": "28 January, 2026",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 1924,
          "end": 1940
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2781484127044678
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "1 P.S.I. Katkar called two panch witnesses for breaking the lock of the shutter and for recording the seizure panchnama.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1996,
      "end": 2117,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.240840345621109
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "Accordingly, PSI Katkar called Awaij Shaikh and Shaikh Ameer to act as panchas.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2118,
      "end": 2197,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Katkar",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2135,
          "end": 2141
        },
        {
          "text": "Awaij Shaikh",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2149,
          "end": 2161
        },
        {
          "text": "Shaikh Ameer",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2166,
          "end": 2178
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19416265189647675
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "They were informed of the secret information received and were asked whether they were willing to witness the breaking of the lock and seizure proceedings.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2198,
      "end": 2353,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.22609472274780273
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Upon their consent, one person,\nShaikh Imran, resident of Swarajya Nagar, Barshi Road, was also called, and in his presence, the lock of Madina Traders was broken.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2354,
      "end": 2517,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Shaikh Imran",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2386,
          "end": 2398
        },
        {
          "text": "Madina Traders",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 2491,
          "end": 2505
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21401728689670563
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "The shop was searched, and a seizure panchnama was prepared.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2518,
      "end": 2578,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2054252028465271
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "Inside the shop, packets of Gutka and other scented pan masalas were found.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2579,
      "end": 2654,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gutka",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 2607,
          "end": 2612
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19341997802257538
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "A cash amount of Rs. 63,160/- was also recovered from the counter box.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2655,
      "end": 2725,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.16818620264530182
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "All the above muddemal was seized in the presence of the panchas, and a seizure panchnama was effected.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2726,
      "end": 2829,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19672748446464539
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 22,
      "text": "Thereafter, Food and Drugs Inspector, was informed telephonically.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2830,
      "end": 2896,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.18853747844696045
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 23,
      "text": "One packet from the seized articles was preserved for CA sample.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2897,
      "end": 2961,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20717908442020416
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 24,
      "text": "It is alleged that the accused had stocked Gutka and Pan Masala for sale, which is prohibited by 3 930.ABA-2166-2025.doc the Maharashtra Government, and such sale poses danger to human life.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2962,
      "end": 3152,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Gutka",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3005,
          "end": 3010
        },
        {
          "text": "Pan Masala",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 3015,
          "end": 3025
        },
        {
          "text": "3 930.ABA-2166-2025.doc the",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3059,
          "end": 3086
        },
        {
          "text": "Maharashtra Government",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3087,
          "end": 3109
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.21679919958114624
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 25,
      "text": "On the basis of the said report, Peth Beed Police registered Crime No. 309/2025 dated 07.11.2025 under Sections 123, 223, 274, and 275 of B.N.S. 2023.\n4.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 3153,
      "end": 3306,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Peth Beed Police",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 3186,
          "end": 3202
        },
        {
          "text": "Crime No. 309/2025",
          "label": "CASE_NUMBER",
          "start": 3214,
          "end": 3232
        },
        {
          "text": "07.11.2025",
          "label": "DATE",
          "start": 3239,
          "end": 3249
        },
        {
          "text": "Sections 123",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3256,
          "end": 3268
        },
        {
          "text": "223",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3270,
          "end": 3273
        },
        {
          "text": "274",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3275,
          "end": 3278
        },
        {
          "text": "275",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3284,
          "end": 3287
        },
        {
          "text": "B.N.S. 2023",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3291,
          "end": 3302
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.19859211146831512
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 26,
      "text": "The learned Counsel for the Applicant submits that there has been non-compliance with Section 105 of the BNS, inasmuch as the search and seizure of the contraband ought to have been video recorded by the police authorities.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3307,
      "end": 3530,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 105",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 3393,
          "end": 3404
        },
        {
          "text": "BNS",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 3412,
          "end": 3415
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.4005441665649414
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 27,
      "text": "Such non-compliance vitiates the entire seizure, and therefore the Applicant is entitled to be released on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3531,
      "end": 3643,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.308872252702713
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 28,
      "text": "The learned Counsel further submits that the contraband was seized from the spot, therefore the custody of the Applicant is not required.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3644,
      "end": 3781,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2151331603527069
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 29,
      "text": "The entire seizure was conducted in the absence of the Applicant, and therefore the search and seizure stand vitiated.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3782,
      "end": 3900,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3817816972732544
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 30,
      "text": "Consequently, the Applicant is entitled to be released on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_PETITIONER",
      "start": 3901,
      "end": 3964,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.31025734543800354
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 31,
      "text": "The Applicant is falsely implicated in the present crime.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 3965,
      "end": 4022,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.28626877069473267
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 32,
      "text": "There is a delay of 8 hours in lodging the FIR.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4023,
      "end": 4070,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.26543331146240234
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 33,
      "text": "The alleged muddemal/contraband was seized from the staircase in front of the Applicant's shop.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4071,
      "end": 4166,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2796528935432434
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 34,
      "text": "The Applicant is added as an accused merely on suspicion.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4167,
      "end": 4224,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3406306803226471
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 35,
      "text": "Hence, the Applicant may be released on bail.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4225,
      "end": 4270,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.2636757493019104
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 36,
      "text": "5. As against this, the learned APP strongly opposes the present application on the ground that the Applicant is involved in serious offences relating to the sale of contraband Gutka, which is prohibited by orders of the Commissioner for Food Safety vide notification issued under Section 30 of the Food Safety and 4 930.ABA-2166-2025.doc Standards Act.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4272,
      "end": 4625,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Section 30",
          "label": "PROVISION",
          "start": 4553,
          "end": 4563
        },
        {
          "text": "Food Safety and 4 930.ABA-2166-2025.doc Standards Act",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 4571,
          "end": 4624
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.32779189944267273
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 37,
      "text": "The learned APP further submits that the Applicant was contacted telephonically on his mobile number 9561031002 and was directed to remain present for the search and seizure.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4626,
      "end": 4800,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.1307341754436493
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 38,
      "text": "However, the Applicant failed to do so.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4801,
      "end": 4840,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23332282900810242
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 39,
      "text": "The entire search and seizure panchnama was prepared, and video recording of the same was made on a mobile phone.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4841,
      "end": 4954,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "arguments",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.23682257533073425
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 40,
      "text": "A separate panchnama to that effect was also prepared on 07.11.2025, i.e., the date of the raid.",
      "rhetorical_role": "ARG_RESPONDENT",
      "start": 4955,
      "end": 5051,
      "entities": [
        {
