      "summary_sent_score": 0.38758406043052673
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 59,
      "text": "Taking into consideration the criminal antecedents of the Applicant,\nthere is every likelihood that if 6 930.ABA-2166-2025.doc released on anticipatory bail, he may again indulge in similar offences.",
